HEADER    DNA-CAOX GEL-FIRST (NO WHEWELLITE LATTICE)
TITLE     CAOX HYDRATE AT EVERY PHOSPHATE; INDEPENDENT ORIENTATIONS
REMARK   1 Gel-first (templating_gel_altP): CaOx hydrate at every other P per strand; no xtl lattice.
